<Content title="Account Deletion | OpenArabic" description="How to delete your OpenArabic account and its data." canonical="/account-deletion">
  <div class="legal">
    <h1>Account deletion</h1>
    <p>This page is for the OpenArabic app by Yunus Andréasson.</p>
    <p>To delete your OpenArabic account and data, send an email to <a href="mailto:yunus@edenmind.com?subject=Account%20Deletion%20Request">yunus@edenmind.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>What gets deleted</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Your account profile and sign-in credentials</li>
      <li>Your reading progress and article history</li>
      <li>Your vocabulary data and practice records</li>
      <li>Your preferences and settings</li>
    </ul>
    <p>All data is deleted within 7 business days after verification. No personal data is retained.</p>
    <h2>How it is verified</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>We send a verification link to your email.</li>
      <li>Click the link to confirm the deletion.</li>
      <li>Your account is deleted within 7 business days.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Account deletion is permanent and cannot be undone.</p>
  </div>
</Content>
